name = "Wanderer – Burst"
element = "Wind"
description = "Deals wind damage to all enemies within a 3x3 area of his choosing within 3 tiles of him. For each ally of the following elements this ability also receives the following:
Water - Heal any allies within the 3x3 for 1D4.
Fire - Adds +2 Damage to the 3x3
Electric - Gains 2 burst charges back from this.
Ice - Enemies hit gain disadvantage on their next attack."
